  "heading": "Conveyance of prisoner from place to place.",
  "chapter": null,
  "order": 169,
  "text": "A person under sentence of transportation or imprisonment may, during his conveyance from place to place, or when on board a ship, aircraft, or otherwise, be subjected to such restraint as is necessary for his safe conduct and removal.",
